  welcomeMessage: Welcome to C-ConQuest! Now that you've learned how to use some
    common contractions in braille and its proper usage, let's try using it to construct
    a sentence.
  letsLearnMessage: Let's put your knowledge to the test. In this quest, you're going
    to construct a sentence with the use of common contractions.
  completedMessage: Congratulation! You did an amazing job.
  repeatQuestionMessage: You finished your journey on C-ConQuest. Do you want to
    repeat again and try beating your high score? Press repeat to repeat or next
    to finish.
